{#
  The verify Job's identity, INERT until tdarr's flip, as `job.yaml.j2` beside it is.

  It is a ServiceAccount with no Role. The Job reads no API and execs into no pod, so it needs
  no grant, and its pod mounts no token. tdarr's VAAPI encode through its own ffmpeg is the
  one check that would need `pods/exec`, and it stays an Ansible task (the PR that added this
  file names why).
#}
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: ServiceAccount
metadata:
  name: tdarr-verify
  namespace: {{ k8s_namespace }}
automountServiceAccountToken: false
